    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi, dubbi buufata, oboleyaani, Waaqa nuu kad'ad'a, aka dubbini Aabbo fulla ch'ufa geete dabsattu, akuma jiddu teesaniti taate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle Waaqa kad'ad'a, aka inni harka nama hamamatiifi ka dabaati nuu baasu. Wonti akanatiifi nami ch'ufti d'ugefacha inqabu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo Aabbooni ka d'ugaati. Inni isani jabeeseti Sheet'anale isani iraa d'owa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aabbooni ya isani nu d'ugefachiise; ammalle nu imbeenna, aka isani waan nu isaniti himnu ch'ufa arrafi hegerile guuttani:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aabbooni jaalala Waaqaatiifi obsa Kristoni namaa kennuti isani akheekhiina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Huji hojad'a",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maqa Aabbo Yeso Kristotiini isaniti himna, oboleyaani teenna: oboleyaani huji hojachu diddu ch'ufa lagad'a, ka waan nu barsiimne gula indeemne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaniyu imbeetani, aka waan nu tolchine tolchu maltani. Gaafa isani woliini jirru nu huji hojachu indinne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qarqaarsa nama tokole bilaasha imfud'anne. Ammo halkani guyya gaargalle hojanne, aka nu nama tokole ind'imne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nu waan kana maro waan nu argachu malle nuu kenna jechu indandeenneefi, jechu indinne, ammo aka akheekha dansa isani agarsiimnuufi dinne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaafa isani woliini jirru, Nami hojachu didu sagale inyaatini jenne.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti nu waan kana jennuufi, waan aka nami gari jiddu teesani keesa huji hojachu dide waan nama d'ibi ch'alla yaku jiru d'ageenneefi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maqa Aabbo Yeso Kristotiini jara suni himne gorsina: Huji teesani laana hojad'a, ufi bulcha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo isani, oboleyaani teenna, waan dansa tolchu indad'abiina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami toko hegeri d'aamsa nu tatabe tana keesati t'aamnu inguutufa. Nama suni ilaala, lagad'a, aka inni ufumaani ch'eeru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo aka nyaapa isa intolchiina, aka oboleesa gorsa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Dubbi eege",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aabbooni, ka nagaya namaa kennu, hojja ch'ufaafi guyya ch'ufa nagaya isani guutinna. Aabbooni isani ch'ufa woliini ha tau.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2TH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waan kana anini harkuma kiyyaani t'aafa: Pauloni nagaya isani fuud'a. Anini tatabe ch'ufa akana maqa kiyya jalati t'aafa; anini akana t'aafa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2TH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2TH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
